  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogokanigwa gw’okwenaria gete ase ebirero",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inwe n’abana ba Omonene Nyasae oino. Timwesaraga emebere yaino gose gwekigita chitukia chia bosio ase emetwe yaino ekero mokoreera abakuure,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekiagera inwe n’abanto abachenu ase Omonene Nyasae oino. Ere obachoorire mobe abanto baye, mwaatananegete korwa ase abanto b’ebisaku binde bionsi bire ase ense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ching’iti chichenegete na echitachenegeti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Abal 11:1-47)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Timobaisa koria ng’iti ende yonsi y’okogeechia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Echi nachio ching’iti moraabe mokoria: chiombe, ne’ching’ondi, ne’chimbori,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne’chinsune, ne’chingabi, ne’ebisia, ne’chimbori chi’orosana, ne’chiburo, ne’chitobe, ne’ching’ondi chi’orosana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera eng’iti ebwate ebitaago biatananegete gati ase chinsemo ibere, naende chikoria eng’ang’ura, echio nachio morarie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ching’iti echio chikoria eng’ang’ura gose chibwate ebitaago biatananegete, timoria echio: engamia, na egesusu, na egesengi. Echio nigo chikoria eng’ang’ura, korende tichibwati ebitaago biatananegete, ase ayio tichichenegeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timoria embeche; nebwate ebitaago biatananegete, korende teri koria eng’ang’ura. Ase ayio n’ebe ase more ey’etachenegeti. Timoria chinyama chie ching’iti echio gose timokuna emebere yabo ekero chi akuure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase echio chionsi chire ase amaache ime ’monyaare koria chinswe chibwate chingondo chinga buna chimbaaba, na amagoocho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinde chionsi chitabwati chingondo chinga buna chimbaaba, na amagoocho, timochiria; echio ’nchibe echitachenegeti ase more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Chinyoni chionsi chichenegete ’namochirie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timoria chinyoni echi: ekeongo, na ensoti, na obotere;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amakoru na ebisaku biamwabo;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebigonkoru na ebisaku biamwabo bionsi;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "esagero na omoyaaye, na enyakooboke, na enyautuutu, na ebisaku biamwabo;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enyakweumia enke na enene, na etibibi;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "etekere, na ekeongo kende, na omoneke,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na amaagonga na ebisaku biamwabo, na enteema bobe, na egetabora mato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ebisaku bionsi bi’ebitongwa ebisinini bikoiruruka ne’chimbaaba tibichenegeti ase more, timobiria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebitongwa bichenegete naende bibwate chimbaaba nabo moranyaare kobiria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eng’iti ekwete yoka enyene timoyeria. Monyaare koyea omomenyi omenyete amo nainwe ase omochie oino, ayerie, gose moyeoonerie omonto bw’egesaku ekeao, korende inwe n’abanto abachenu, mwatananire ase Omonene Nyasae oino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Timobaisa koiyekera emanwa y’embori ime y’amabeere y’eng’ina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogochika gw’okorua ensemo ya ikomi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Goika morue ensemo ya ikomi ye chindagera chi’emegondo yaino echio chikwama kera omwaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo ase obosio bw’Omonene Nyasae oino, aase arachore abe obomenyo bw’erieta riaye, nao morariere ensemo ya ikomi ye’chindagera chiaino, n’edivai, n’amaguta, ne’chintangi chi’echiombe, ne’ching’ondi, ne’chimbori; erinde monyaare kweorokereria komoiroka Omonene Nyasae oino, botambe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye aase agwo Omonene achoorire abe obomenyo bw’erieta riaye are aare mono, motanyaare kobogoria ensemo ya ikomi y’eri’Omonene Nyasae oino, abasesenirie n’ero,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rirorio moonchorerie ebinto ebio ase chitaabu, erinde mochiire aase agwo Omonene oino achoorire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chibesa echio mogore chiombe, gose ching’ondi, gose edivai, gose ebinyugwa ebiroro, kende gionsi moganetie. Mobiriere agwo ase obosio bw’Omonene Nyasae oino, erinde mogooke amo n’abanto b’echinka chiaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Timotiga gookonya Abalawi bamenyete ase emechie yaino, ekiagera barabwo tibabwati emegondo gose omwando amo nainwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omoerio o kera emiaka etato morente ensemo ya ikomi ye’chindagera chi’emegondo chi’omwaka oria, moyegache ase emechie yaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endagera eyio ney’Abalawi, ekiagera barabwo tibabwati omwando bw’oboremo, na ey’abamenyi ne chintakana, na ababoraka bare ase emechie yaino. Abwo mbachiche barie endagera eyio baisaneke. Erio nario Omonene Nyasae oino, arabasesenie ase emeremo yaino yonsi mogokora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "DEU.15",
    "number": "15",
